# Elite morning send schedule

**AM Brief** runs **every day** (Sun–Sat) at **10:00 AM Israel** via
`Elite_AMBrief_10AM_Israel` (WakeToRun, StartWhenAvailable).

| Run day | Report |
|---------|--------|
| **Every day (scheduled)** | AM Brief — catch-up through yesterday (max **2** missing days per run) |
| **Daily summary** | **Never scheduled** — do not enable `Elite_DailySummary_10AM_Israel`; run only when the user explicitly asks (Cursor / manual) |
| **Weekend bundle (manual)** | `generate_morning_elite.py --force weekend` — prior Thu–Sat |

After a **manual** daily/weekend summary, run `publish_pages_git.py` for GitHub Pages.

AM Brief is **not** on the daily summary task. Full AM backfill:
`generate_am_brief_range.py --catch-up --verify`.
